/// NodeUp — system event announced when a visible node connects to this one
/// (ADR 0126 §8).
///
/// Published on `SystemAnnouncer current` by the runtime's
/// `beamtalk_node_monitor`, which re-announces `net_kernel:monitor_nodes/2`
/// events. Hidden (tooling) nodes never announce, and announcements stay
/// node-local: each node announces its own view of cluster membership.
///
/// ## Examples
/// ```beamtalk
/// SystemAnnouncer current when: NodeUp do: [:e |
///   Transcript showLine: "joined " ++ e node name asString
/// ]
/// ```
sealed typed Announcement subclass: NodeUp
  field: node :: Node
